<title>USA: Folgers revises its coffee price increase.</title>
<headline>Folgers revises its coffee price increase.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Procter and Gamble's Folgers Coffee Co said it revised its increase on the list price on its standard 13-ounce can of coffee to 45 cents, rather than the 15-cent increase announced Feb 10, to reflect the price of green coffee on the world's futures markets.</p>
<p>The increase, which is to take effect on March 3 -- moved up from the previously announced March 17 -- brings the new price for a standard can to $2.71, the company said.</p>
</text>
